<title>LATVIA: TWO YIELDS DOWN, ONE UP AT T-BILL SALE.</title>
<headline>TWO YIELDS DOWN, ONE UP AT T-BILL SALE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yields on three and six month</p>
<p>government Treasury bills fell at auction on Wednesday while</p>
<p>short-term 28-day yields fell, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> One month    3.95	  3.84	 2	    0.5   0.4  0.4</p>
<p> Three-month  4.03	  4.05	 5	    0.7   1.5  0.7</p>
<p> Six-month    4.24	  4.60	 5	    2.0   3.7  2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
